    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "0FF6C9F97A03F66F",
      "text": "Es ist Tradition, neuen Schülern der Akademie\\nein Pokémon zu überreichen.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "0FF6CAF97A03F822",
      "text": "Du kannst selbst entscheiden, welches dieser drei\\nPokémon dir als Partner zur Seite stehen soll.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "0FF6C7F97A03F309",
      "text": "Das hier ist Felori, das Florakatzen-Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0060_poke_a_01",
      "hash64": "48BC6D79381FC421",
      "text": "Looori!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "0FF6D0F97A040254",
      "text": "Das ist Krokel, das Feuerkroko-Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0060_poke_b_01",
      "hash64": "EF87AD5FF0CE9DAE",
      "text": "Krooo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "0FF6D1F97A040407",
      "text": "Und zu guter Letzt hätten wir Kwaks,\\ndas Jungenten-Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0060_poke_c_01",
      "hash64": "C49D196B39DB3303",
      "text": "Kwaaa!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "0FFA4EF97A070E45",
      "text": "Sie sind alle sehr anhänglich. Meist wollen sie\\ngar nicht von meiner Seite weichen.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "0FFA4DF97A070C92",
      "text": "Nanu...?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "0FF6CBF97A03F9D5",
      "text": "Oh... Sie scheinen dich sehr interessant zu finden.\\nDann bin ich wohl abgeschrieben.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "0FF6C4F97A03EDF0",
      "text": "Ich wäre ja gerne dabei, während du dein\\nPokémon auswählst, aber ich muss mich so\\r\\nlangsam zum nächsten Hausbesuch aufmachen...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "0FF6C5F97A03EFA3",
      "text": "Du findest mich in dem Haus dort drüben.\\c\\nLass dir ruhig Zeit, genügend über deine Wahl\\nnachzudenken, und gib mir Bescheid, wenn du\\r\\ndich entschieden hast.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0060_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "0FF6C6F97A03F156",
      "text": "Nun denn, ich empfehle mich.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_01",
      "hash64": "3C5488FF337D9E1E",
      "text": "Ach, der Direktor ist so unglaublich höflich und\\naufmerksam, findest du nicht?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_02",
      "hash64": "3C5487FF337D9C6B",
      "text": "Diese drei Pokémon sind wirklich herzallerliebst!\\nWie soll man sich da nur für eines entscheiden...[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_03",
      "hash64": "3C5486FF337D9AB8",
      "text": "Wie wäre es, wenn du sie auf einen kleinen\\ngemeinsamen Spaziergang mitnimmst und\\r\\nschaust, wie das so läuft?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_04",
      "hash64": "3C548DFF337DA69D",
      "text": "So lernst du die drei vielleicht besser kennen.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_05",
      "hash64": "3C548CFF337DA4EA",
      "text": "Ach! Bevor du losziehst, habe ich noch ein\\nGeschenk für dich. Zur Feier deiner Aufnahme\\r\\nan der Akademie![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_06",
      "hash64": "3C548BFF337DA337",
      "text": "Das ist ein nagelneues Smartphone! Ich lese dir\\nmal aus der Bedienungsanleitung vor...\\c\\n„Wenn du nicht weißt, wo es langgeht,\\ndrücke den [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Y-Knopf[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].“\\c\\nAnscheinend kannst du damit die Karte aufrufen.\\nWie praktisch! Pass gut auf dein Handy auf, ja?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 255,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_07",
      "hash64": "3C548AFF337DA184",
      "text": "Jetzt aber los mit dir! Viel Spaß![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
